{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955840/extras/KW_title0.png?t=1744994206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kitchen Wars is an action-packed game where players of 1-8 players aim to sabotage each other\u2019s restaurants while keeping their customers satisfied. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use weapons, steal chairs, throw items, level up to unlock boosters, and have a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955840/extras/NewGif01.gif?t=1744994206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955840/extras/KW_title00.png?t=1744994206\" /> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Serve Your Clients:</strong> Deliver meals quickly to keep customers happy and satisfied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Purchase Upgrades and Items:</strong> Enhance your kitchen and unlock powerful boosters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attack the Opposing Restaurant:</strong> Disrupt your rivals with strategic attacks and sabotage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steal Chairs:</strong> Reduce your competitor\u2019s seating capacity by swiping their chairs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Restaurant:</strong> Earn money from happy clients to invest in your kitchen and secure victory. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955840/extras/Newgif02.gif?t=1744994206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955840/extras/KW_title2.png?t=1744994206\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local Multiplayer  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Remote Play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955840/extras/Newgif03.gif?t=1744994206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're focused on improving your restaurant or causing chaos for your opponents, Kitchen Wars offers a blend of strategy, combat, and humor for an entertaining and competitive experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Customer Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955840/dda4eb3c40dcb5f93bce442750f9fb9ac8fa81a4.jpg"},{"name":"Customer Service Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955840/f2ecb66663e63868fb846abd3da649f3fa68e1ad.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless Business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955840/698d7b92d910d7125d4900853e85f7ccca0c5dc8.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955840/a45bf25ed5353d8978d34cc905e7c54a77aadbb5.jpg"},{"name":"Last-Minute Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955840/c4ea6fcc9503fa34817a8c56bdaca5ac2776c712.jpg"},{"name":"Chair Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955840/ed378a9fbfd356e2661e0107513d73446fe4dcc4.jpg"},{"name":"Trash Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955840/bcd6c006bb909b698028fad02de622d0247d848a.jpg"},{"name":"Explosive Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955840/09afbc5ecd768468dc9a83cf0e6b3a2656e21cd2.jpg"},{"name":"Home Delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955840/66e09f5db158e6a608baa191d0fd7e3